# W910 deployment upload boundaries (repo-root deploy, project rootDirectory=apps/web).
# Everything NOT ignored here is uploaded as the deployment source; the build
# then runs `bun install` at the repo root and `next build` in apps/web.
# Keep this list aligned with the workspace dependency closure of apps/web:
# packages/contracts, packages/capability, packages/identity (runtime) and
# packages/output-pipeline (type-only pins in tests) must NOT be ignored.
.git
.github
.vercel
docs
tests
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test
**/*.test.ts
**/scripts
*.log
.DS_Store
